    <div class="lesson-head">
      <div class="lesson-heading">
        <div class="lesson-number"><div class="heading-md">2</div></div>
        <div class="lesson-title">
          <h2 class="heading-md">Offset <br />and Delay</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lesson-desc">
        <p class="body-md">
          A slight delay between two or more objects creates a feeling of softness and multi-layered movement. This technique also helps to direct the
          user&#x27;s attention, indicating an objects&#x27;s place within a hierarchy of elements.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div></div>
  <div data-motion="lesson-cases" class="lesson-cases">
    <div data-motion="lesson-cases-head" class="lesson-cases-head"><h3 class="heading-xl">Implementation examples</h3></div>
    <div class="lesson-cases-pin">
      <div data-motion="lesson-track" class="lesson-cases-track">
