          </div>
          <div class="lesson-card-body">
            <div class="lesson-card-text">
              <p class="body-sm">Here, content elements appear one by one, adding softness to the movement and creating the impression of viscosity.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="lesson-card-btn">
              <div>View</div>
              <div class="lesson-card-icon w-embed">
