            ><img src="/assets/PlayStation-5-Promo_desktop_00000.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="lesson-card-poster" />
          </div>
          <div class="lesson-card-body">
            <div class="lesson-card-text">
              <p class="body-sm">
                Having the visual elements arrive one at a time gives each of them a chance to shine and makes the whole effect more engaging.
